{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b> Wise of heart</b> — that the wisdom is in his heart." "<b> Will take commandments</b> — that others will teach him." "<b> And a fool of lips</b> — that his lips will speak folly." "<b> Shall be thrown down</b> — the meaning is, he shall stumble."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:50.214552315Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}